From: Demo Solution Team <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] cm: preserve final-owner storage and mainline UID ownership

Consolidate residual node validation, pending startup rebalance and
shared-storage retention on the mainline stable-UID launcher. Preserve
failed retirements and release only acquired UID/GID references.
No schema, quota, identity, TTL or Cloud protocol change.

Upstream-Status: Pending [native regression proof; mainline migration]
Base: aos_core_lib_cpp 5560291ba6914e36a5b841ade4d8fc54134a9e91

